null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Nfxaq4LgfuSmV99mqTuRD3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build fails because `tests/test_money.py` expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` (even though its docstring already said HALF_EVEN).\n\nChange: switch `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.\n\nNeeded for today's release.", "reviewers": ["code-owner"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01VxainfgE3DssHXpTG9kuuT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "confidence": 0.75}, "name": "merge_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug and merged it into main, so it should ship in today's release.\n\n1. **The problem:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring said banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed: it expects `2.665` to round to `2.66`.\n2. **The fix:** I created the branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding` from main and committed a one-line change that switches the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n3. **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n4. **PR and merge:** I opened PR #101 against main with `code-owner` as reviewer. The merge was sent to a code owner for approval, as policy requires, and they approved it (\"Approved. Looks right.\"). PR #101 is now merged.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system didn't recognise that ID, so I relied on the code's docstring and the test.", "type": "text"}]}]}